    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A first-person horror game about a historian who discovers an old map leading to a hidden village. Intrigued, he decides to explore it. However, he is unaware that this village was once terrorized by an evil witch who unleashed chaos and destruction upon the villagers. In their desperation, the villagers sealed her away and abandoned the village, leaving behind warnings to never return.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Despite the warnings, you, an enthusiastic historian, decide to explore the village, inadvertently dismantling the protections the villagers had placed, ultimately releasing the vengeful witch who now hunts you down.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game features jump scares, loud noises, and flashing lights.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You play in an open-world environment, exploring the abandoned village and interacting with objects as you progress toward your goal.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A first-person horror game about a historian who discovers an old map leading to a hidden village. Intrigued, he decides to explore it. However, he is unaware that this village was once terrorized by an evil witch who unleashed chaos and destruction upon the villagers. In their desperation, the villagers sealed her away and abandoned the village, leaving behind warnings to never return.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Despite the warnings, you, an enthusiastic historian, decide to explore the village, inadvertently dismantling the protections the villagers had placed, ultimately releasing the vengeful witch who now hunts you down.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game features jump scares, loud noises, and flashing lights.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You play in an open-world environment, exploring the abandoned village and interacting with objects as you progress toward your goal.</i></p>",
